--- !u!114 &1452191787
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1452191782}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 520b57938ba69804a80cc749a79820c3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  playOnStart: 1
  lines:
  - speaker: Grandma
    text: It rained heavily that night.
    speed: 1
    pitch: 1
    blip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Grandma
    text: After she ran away, I didn't go looking for her
    speed: 1
    pitch: 1
    blip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Grandma
    text: 'I thought she was only upset with me. I thought

      she would come
      home.'
    speed: 1
    pitch: 1
    blip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Grandma
    text: But she never did
    speed: 1
    pitch: 1
    blip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Grandma
    text: I found her in the well the next morning
    speed: 1
    pitch: 1
    blip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Grandma
    text: 'Everyone said the old man in the photograph had

      taken her.'
    speed: 1
    pitch: 1
    blip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Grandma
    text: I never corrected them
    speed: 1
    pitch: 1
    blip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Grandma
    text: Because I knew why she had run away that night.
    speed: 1
    pitch: 1
    blip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Grandma
    text: I was the one who frightened her.
    speed: 1
    pitch: 1
    blip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Grandma
    text: I was the one who made her believe the dead would come for her.
    speed: 1
    pitch: 1
    blip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Grandma
    text: 'For years, I told myself it was only an accident. '
    speed: 1
    pitch: 1
    blip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Grandma
    text: But I could never forget the way she looked at me that day.
    speed: 1
    pitch: 1
    blip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Me
    text: '"Grandma..."

      "You carried this with you all your life."'
    speed: 1
    pitch: 1
    blip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Me
    text: '"But there''s still something I don''t understand."

      "How did she
      appear in that photograph?"'
    speed: 1
    pitch: 1
    blip: {fileID: 0}
  lineBackgrounds:
  - {fileID: -3356121072021684518, guid: 461db263d26f84547b174408cc8eac7a, type: 3}
